  "details": "Apple device and iOS version:\n\nIPhone 14 on Version 17.5.1\n\nInstalled VRC Testflight Version and VRC Build Number\n\n2024.2.3 (333) and VRC Build 1472\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe battery icon in the bottom right of the screen that appears when holding down on the hamburger menu begins going red at 17% when it should be 20%\n\nSteps I took:\n\nWaited for my phone to get to 20% and took screenshots of both the battery icon in VRC and in my apple pulldown menu and kept checking each percent change till the battery in VRC turned red\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nThe battery icon would turn red at 20% and lower\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nThe battery icon turns red at 17% and lower",
